{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>And He met him, YHWH</b> — Two times in the Masorah: this one and the other: ויפגשהו בהר האלהים (and He met him at the mountain of Elohim). To teach: at the time Moses slackened from circumcision, wrath and fury came to swallow him, and he could not withstand them, until Aaron came and assisted him, as it says: ויפגשהו בהר האלהים — and by his merit he was saved."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:11:54.821881990Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}